{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2551","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2551/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2551/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2551/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2551","id":4704787512,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc8AAAABGG1cOA","number":2551,"title":"【强烈建议】希望 Trae 支持类似 Claude /btw 或 Codex /side 的旁路任务能力","user":{"login":"VectorPeak","id":73048950,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDQ4OTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73048950?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VectorPeak","html_url":"https://github.com/VectorPeak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VectorPeak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VectorPeak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VectorPeak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VectorPeak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VectorPeak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VectorPeak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VectorPeak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VectorPeak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VectorPeak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-20T02:21:04Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T03:25:04Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"我强烈建议 Trae / SOLO 支持类似 Claude Code 的 `/btw`，或 Codex 的 `/side` 这类“旁路任务”能力。\n\n在实际使用 Agent 处理长任务时，这个需求非常常见。\n\n比如 Agent 正在执行一个较长的开发任务：修改代码、排查问题、运行测试、整理方案、做重构等。这个过程中，用户经常会临时想到一些相关问题，例如想让 Agent 顺手解释一个报错、查一下某个函数在哪里被调用、确认某个依赖是否还在使用，或者补充一个背景信息。\n\n但这些临时问题，并不一定意味着用户想改变当前主任务。\n\n现在 Trae 的交互方式更像是一条单线对话流。用户只要在当前对话里插入一句话，Agent 就可能把它理解成新的任务方向，或者把它混入原来的任务规划里。这样一来，主任务容易被打断，上下文也会变得不够清晰。\n\n我的诉求很明确：\n\n希望 Trae 提供一种方式，让用户可以明确表达：\n\n> 这是一个旁路问题 / 临时任务，不要改变当前主任务；处理完之后，请继续回到原来的任务。\n\n例如：\n\n```text\n/btw 解释一下这个报错的原因，但不要改变当前修复计划\n```\n\n或者：\n\n```text\n/side 查一下这个函数在哪里被调用，完成后继续刚才的重构任务\n```\n\n希望这类能力至少具备以下特性：\n\n1. `/btw` 或 `/side` 触发的内容应被视为旁路任务，而不是新的主任务。\n2. 旁路任务不应覆盖、重置或污染当前主任务目标。\n3. 旁路任务完成后，Agent 应该能回到原来的任务上下文。\n4. UI 上最好能区分“主任务”和“旁路任务”，让用户知道当前处理的是哪条任务线。\n5. 旁路任务可以先从轻量场景开始支持，例如查询文件、解释代码、搜索上下文、回答临时问题。\n6. 如果旁路任务涉及修改文件或执行命令，再按现有安全策略进行确认即可。\n\n这个能力对长任务体验非常关键。\n\nAgent 在真实开发场景中，通常不会只处理一个完全线性的任务。开发过程中经常会出现临时确认、旁路检查、局部解释、风险验证等需求。如果这些内容都只能塞进同一条主线对话里，任务边界会越来越模糊，Agent 也更容易跑偏。\n\n一些很典型的场景包括：\n\n- 解释某个报错，但继续当前修复任务。\n- 查询某个函数的调用位置，但不要改变当前实现计划。\n- 临时确认某个依赖是否还在使用，然后回到主任务。\n- 回答一个背景问题，但不要把它作为新的开发目标。\n- 插入一个旁路检查，但主任务目标保持不变。\n\n现在缺少这类机制时，用户在长任务中途反而不太敢提问，因为担心把 Agent 的任务方向带偏。对 SOLO / Agent 这类产品来说，这会影响长任务的可控性和可靠性。\n\n如果 Trae 的定位是 Agentic IDE，而不仅仅是普通聊天面板，那么它应该具备更清晰的任务管理能力：\n\n- 主任务应该稳定\n- 旁路任务应该隔离\n- 临时问题不应该污染主线\n- 用户应该能明确表达“这是旁路，不要打断当前任务”\n- Agent 应该能在旁路任务后恢复原来的任务现场\n\n如果完整的多任务并行实现成本较高，可以先支持一个轻量版本，例如：\n\n```text\n/btw <临时问题>\n/side <旁路检查>\n/resume 回到主任务\n/main 查看当前主任务\n```\n\n哪怕第一版只是做上下文标记和任务恢复，也会明显改善长任务体验。\n\n这类能力不是锦上添花，而是 Agent 长任务场景里非常核心的交互能力。希望 Trae 团队可以认真考虑支持。","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2551/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2551/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4760780972","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2551#issuecomment-4760780972","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2551","id":4760780972,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc8AAAABG8PArA","user":{"login":"NicholasHwang","id":6527348,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjczNDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6527348?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasHwang","html_url":"https://github.com/NicholasHwang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasHwang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasHwang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasHwang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasHwang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasHwang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasHwang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasHwang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasHwang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasHwang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T03:25:04Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T03:25:04Z","body":"支持，目前长任务已经在开发中有很多场景需要使用了。这个时候发现中间某个步骤的一个小问题，需要旁路命令来解决这个小问题，不然只能中断长任务来解决小问题或者等待长任务再回头看小问题。这种方式很有可能已经遗失了相关上下文等","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4760780972/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}